MobileNetV3

This package is a header: a manifest and a build script that tell a host where to
fetch a machine-learning model and how to use it. It contains no model weights of
its own, and it claims no licence over them.

The weights are the work of their creators and are governed solely by their terms.

The upstream repository states NO licence for these weights.

This package therefore cannot tell you their terms, and neither asserts nor
implies any. Obtain permission from the creators before relying on them.
Upstream: https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/mobilenetv3_small_100

As declared in this package's manifest:
  - image-labeling: Apache-2.0 (MobileNetV3, Google / timm)
  - image-embedding: Apache-2.0 (MobileNetV3, Google / timm)

The manifest and build script in this repository are dedicated to the public
domain by HereLiesAz (CC0-1.0). Take them freely; the model is not HereLiesAz's to give.
